<title>JAPAN: Nissin Food - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Nissin Food - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		287.84		vs	  275.94</p>
<p> Operating	   22.85		vs	   20.88</p>
<p> Current	     23.33		vs	   22.85</p>
